    "Name": "Typhoon UCV (Tracks)",
    "Details": "After the Clan Invasion, the AFFC was eager to replace the armor forces that had been destroyed with upgraded vehicles. Jalastar Aerospace came forward with a wheeled design, but administrative problems and technical issues delayed full scale production until 3057. \n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 3/5 hexes / 90/150 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Ferro-Fibrous\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       235     35\n<b>Left</b>         200     35\n<b>Right</b>       200     35\n<b>Rear</b>        160     35\n<b>Turret</b>      220     35\n\n<b>Total</b>      1015    175</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Accurate Weapon - Laser</color>",
